  "name": "Cursed!: curse damage ignores Resilient Constitution",
  "contract": [
    "Issue #10788. Sun Clerics carry Resilient Constitution 552011, which halves player-caused damage in the",
    "core's resilience step; a curse is self-cast, so it counted. Curse damage is dealt directly as a share of",
    "max health. On level 20 Sun Clerics with the aura, Combustion 901876 deals 70% of max health over its 7",
    "ticks and Storms deals 40% through two 20% hits of 901846, not the halved 35% and 20%."
  ],
